  "content": {
    "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"601\" class=\"elementor elementor-601\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e906137 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e906137\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b9621a7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"b9621a7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-aa2a31f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"aa2a31f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Disclaimer</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-82b6c52 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"82b6c52\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">General Information</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f39461b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f39461b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"25\">The content on <span data-inline-card=\"true\" data-card-url=\"https://lorenmichaelsharris.com\"><span class=\"loader-wrapper\"><a class=\"_1yt4x7n9 _2rko12b0 _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz1y58 _1rkwglyw _4cvxmr28 _19it1x13 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b1r31 _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehicw00 _1j5pglyw _1di629zg\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" href=\"https://lorenmichaelsharris.com/\" data-testid=\"inline-card-resolved-view\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66\" data-testid=\"inline-card-icon-and-title\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw\">Home</span></span></a></span></span> and all related materials, including coaching, speaking, online courses, emails, social media content, and other communications (collectively, the &#8220;Content&#8221;), are provided by LMH, operating as <span data-inline-card=\"true\" data-card-url=\"http://lorenmichaelsharris.com\"><span class=\"loader-wrapper\"><a class=\"_1yt4x7n9 _2rko12b0 _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz1y58 _1rkwglyw _4cvxmr28 _19it1x13 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b1r31 _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehicw00 _1j5pglyw _1di629zg\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" href=\"http://lorenmichaelsharris.com/\" data-testid=\"inline-card-resolved-view\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66\" data-testid=\"inline-card-icon-and-title\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw\">Home</span></span></a></span></span> , for educational and informational purposes only.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6cb6f83 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6cb6f83\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">No Professional Advice</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-76a02dd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"76a02dd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"312\">Nothing on this Website or in our Content is intended to constitute, or be a substitute for, professional legal, medical, mental health, financial, or other professional advice. You should always seek advice from a qualified professional regarding your specific situation.</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"611\">We do not establish any doctor–patient, therapist–client, attorney–client, or other professional relationship with you by providing the Content or Services.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8ef1bd2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8ef1bd2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Personal Responsibility</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6386793 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6386793\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>You are solely responsible for your own decisions, actions, and results. By using the Website, Content, or Services, you agree to take full responsibility for your choices and to use your own judgment and common sense. You agree not to hold LMH, operating as <span data-inline-card=\"true\" data-card-url=\"http://lorenmichaelsharris.com\"><span class=\"loader-wrapper\"><a class=\"_1yt4x7n9 _2rko12b0 _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz1y58 _1rkwglyw _4cvxmr28 _19it1x13 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b1r31 _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehicw00 _1j5pglyw _1di629zg\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" href=\"http://lorenmichaelsharris.com/\" data-testid=\"inline-card-resolved-view\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66\" data-testid=\"inline-card-icon-and-title\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw\">Home</span></span></a></span></span> , liable for any decisions or outcomes related to information presented.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-830122d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"830122d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Earnings and Results Disclaimer</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d87fe87 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d87fe87\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We may share examples of results, success stories, or testimonials from clients. These are provided for illustrative purposes only and do not guarantee that you will achieve similar results. Your outcomes depend on many factors, including your background, experience, commitment, and other circumstances beyond our control.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c6940a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0c6940a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">No Guarantees</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-78447b5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"78447b5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>While we aim to provide helpful information and high-quality Services, we make no guarantees or warranties regarding any particular results or outcomes from using the Website, Content, or Services.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ff7eaf1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ff7eaf1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Third-Party Links and Resources</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a10bae4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a10bae4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"2100\">Any links to external websites or resources are provided for convenience only. We do not control and are not responsible for the content, policies, or practices of third parties. You access third-party websites at your own risk.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-38831ec elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"38831ec\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Limitation of Liability</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b824044 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b824044\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1970\">To the fullest extent permitted by law, LMH, operating as <span data-inline-card=\"true\" data-card-url=\"http://lorenmichaelsharris.com\"><span class=\"loader-wrapper\"><a class=\"_1yt4x7n9 _2rko12b0 _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz1y58 _1rkwglyw _4cvxmr28 _19it1x13 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b1r31 _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehicw00 _1j5pglyw _1di629zg\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" href=\"http:/